@base = http://127.0.0.1:3090

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Search current/upcoming events; combine filters as needed
GET {{base}}/api/events?location=Southport&category=1

### Public event with newest-first registrations
GET {{base}}/api/events/1

### Registration; repeating this request intentionally returns 409
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Example Attendee",
  "email": "example.attendee@example.com",
  "phone": "0400000000",
  "ticket_quantity": 2
}

### Optional forecast or explicit fallback
GET {{base}}/api/events/1/weather

### Staff sees every publication/date status
GET {{base}}/api/admin/events

### Staff event includes contact details
GET {{base}}/api/admin/events/1

### Protected deletion example: event 1 has registrations, expect 409
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/events/1

### Create a fictional event; copy the returned ID for later PUT/DELETE
POST {{base}}/api/admin/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Community picnic",
  "summary": "A shared afternoon for a local cause.",
  "purpose": "Support the community pantry.",
  "description": "Bring a picnic and meet local volunteers. All welcome.",
  "starts_at": "2026-12-01T12:00:00",
  "ends_at": "2026-12-01T15:00:00",
  "venue": "Community Park",
  "location": "Southport",
  "address": "Marine Parade, Southport QLD",
  "ticket_price": 10,
  "fundraising_goal": 2500,
  "amount_raised": 0,
  "image_path": "/assets/coast.jpg",
  "image_alt": "Gold Coast shoreline",
  "accessibility": "Step-free paths and accessible toilets.",
  "publication_status": "active",
  "category_id": 2,
  "organisation_id": 1,
  "latitude": -27.967,
  "longitude": 153.414
}

### To update, PUT the complete event body above to /api/admin/events/RETURNED_ID.
### To delete an unused test event, DELETE /api/admin/events/RETURNED_ID.
### Do not delete unrelated records during verification.

GET {{base}}/api/admin/categories

### Create category
POST {{base}}/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Example category","description":"A temporary fictional category for an API check."}

### Update using PUT /api/admin/categories/RETURNED_ID with both fields.
### Delete using DELETE /api/admin/categories/RETURNED_ID; in-use returns 409.
